=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# ssh screen-ubuntu2604 ----------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: SSH Login. web-01.example.net runs Ubuntu 26.04 (OpenSSH$
# 10.2p1, ssh.socket). As the VM: 60-cloudimg-settings.conf$
# refuses passwords, prohibit-password; otherwise as debian13.$
$
# SSH Login ####################################################$
$
  [ ] SSH Login            Partial root key-only$
  [+] SSH Auth             Configured key-only auth$
  [ ] SSH Port             Not Configured default (22)$
$
# SSH Configuration --------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Root SSH Login       Key only sshd's default$
   -  Password Login       Off by 60-cloudimg-settings.conf$
   -  SSH Port             22 ssh.socket$
   -  Allowed Users        Anyone$
   -  Logged in as         george, by key$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Disallow root login  Root can't log in over SSH$
   2) Password login on    Let passwords log in again$
   3) Change SSH port      Now 22$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-3 or q]:$
$
$

